text Route15_WestEntrance_2F_Text_GiveItemIfCaughtEnough {
    "Hi! Remember me?\n"
    "I'm one of PROF. OAK's AIDES.\p"
    "If your POKéDEX has complete data\n"
    "on {STR_VAR_1} species, I'm supposed to\l"
    "give you a reward.\p"
    "PROF. OAK entrusted me with the\n"
    "{STR_VAR_2} for you.\p"
    "So, {PLAYER}, let me ask you.\p"
    "Have you gathered data on at least\n"
    "{STR_VAR_1} kinds of POKéMON?$"
}

text Route15_WestEntrance_2F_Text_GreatHereYouGo {
    "Great! You have caught or owned\n"
    "{STR_VAR_3} kinds of POKéMON!\p"
    "Congratulations!\n"
    "Here you go!$"
}

text Route15_WestEntrance_2F_Text_ReceivedItemFromAide {
    "{PLAYER} received the {STR_VAR_2}\n"
    "from the AIDE.$"
}

text Route15_WestEntrance_2F_Text_ExplainExpShare {
    "EXP. SHARE is an item to be held\n"
    "by a POKéMON.\p"
    "The POKéMON will receive a share\n"
    "of the EXP. Points without having\l"
    "to battle.$"
}

text Route15_WestEntrance_2F_Text_LargeShiningBird {
    "Let's see what the binoculars have\n"
    "to show…\p"
    "A large, shining bird is flying\n"
    "toward the sea.$"
}

text Route15_WestEntrance_2F_Text_SmallIslandOnHorizon {
    "Let's see what the binoculars have\n"
    "to show…\p"
    "It looks like a small island on\n"
    "the horizon!$"
}
